<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101827">
  <meta name="description" content="Gyansify HRMS brings employee management, attendance, leave workflows and workforce operations together in one organized workspace.">
  <title><%= typeof title !== "undefined" && title ? title : "Gyansify HRMS | Human Resource Management" %></title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #101827;
      --ink-soft: #263247;
      --muted: #667085;
      --line: #e7ebf2;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-soft: #f6f8fc;
      --brand: #4f46e5;
      --brand-dark: #3730a3;
      --cyan: #67e8f9;
      --radius: 22px;
      --shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(16, 24, 39, .08);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 90px; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: #fff;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    body, button, a { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { max-width: 100%; }
    button { font: inherit; }
    .container { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .skip-link {
      position: absolute; left: 12px; top: -60px; z-index: 999;
      padding: 10px 14px; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .skip-link:focus { top: 12px; }

    /* Standalone public-site header: intentionally no dashboard/sidebar layout */
    .site-header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(231,235,242,.9);
    }
    .nav {
      min-height: 78px; display: flex; align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px;
    }
    .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; min-width: 0; }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; flex: 0 0 44px; display: grid; place-items: center;
      border-radius: 14px; color: #fff; font-weight: 850; font-size: 17px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111827, #3730a3);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(79,70,229,.2); overflow: hidden;
    }
    .brand-mark img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; background: #fff; }
    .brand-copy { display: grid; line-height: 1.2; }
    .brand-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -.5px; }
    .brand-name span { color: #f59e0b; }
    .brand-subtitle { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 750; color: #8792a7; letter-spacing: 1.55px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
    .nav-links > a:not(.button) { color: #596579; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; transition: color .2s; }
    .nav-links > a:not(.button):hover { color: var(--brand); }
    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .menu-toggle {
      display: none; width: 42px; height: 42px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
      min-height: 46px; padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 750; transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s, background .2s;
      cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .button-primary { color: #fff; background: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(16,24,39,.13); }
    .button-primary:hover { background: #263247; box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(16,24,39,.18); }
    .button-outline { border-color: #d8deea; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; }
    .button-outline:hover { border-color: #b7c0d2; background: #f9fafb; }
    .button-light { color: var(--ink); background: #fff; }
    .button-light:hover { background: #eef2ff; }

    .hero {
      position: relative; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate;
      padding: 92px 0 72px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 14%, rgba(129,140,248,.13), transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 26%, rgba(103,232,249,.17), transparent 29%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #f8faff 100%);
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute; width: 420px; height: 420px; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(79,70,229,.08); top: -240px; right: 7%; z-index: -1;
    }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.04fr) minmax(360px, .96fr); gap: 52px; align-items: center; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e3e7f3; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
      color: #4c5570; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: 1.25px; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .eyebrow-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22c55e; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(34,197,94,.12); }
    .hero h1 { max-width: 680px; margin: 24px 0 20px; font-size: clamp(42px, 5.4vw, 69px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -3.8px; font-weight: 850; }
    .hero h1 .gradient-text { color: #6b7280; background: linear-gradient(100deg, #4f46e5, #0891b2); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    .hero-copy { max-width: 590px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 30px; }
    .trust-line { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 17px; margin-top: 25px; color: #758096; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 650; }
    .trust-line span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
    .check { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 17px; height: 17px; border-radius: 50%; background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; }

    .product-preview {
      position: relative; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(214,221,235,.9);
      border-radius: 25px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.82); box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(43,54,92,.14);
      transform: perspective(1200px) rotateY(-3deg) rotateX(1deg);
    }
    .preview-window { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e8ebf4; border-radius: 17px; background: #fff; }
    .preview-topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 15px 17px; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f6; }
    .window-dots { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
    .window-dots i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d9deea; }
    .preview-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: #647089; }
    .preview-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 105px 1fr; min-height: 300px; }
    .preview-sidebar { padding: 16px 9px; background: #f8f9fd; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f6; }
    .mini-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 23px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 850; }
    .mini-brand-icon { width: 21px; height: 21px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 7px; background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; font-size: 10px; }
    .mini-nav { padding: 8px 7px; margin: 5px 0; border-radius: 7px; color: #8a93a6; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
    .mini-nav.active { background: #e9eaff; color: #4338ca; }
    .preview-main { padding: 19px 16px; min-width: 0; }
    .preview-heading { display: flex; align-items: start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
    .preview-heading strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
    .preview-heading small { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: #9aa3b5; font-size: 8px; }
    .preview-pill { padding: 5px 7px; border-radius: 7px; background: #ecfdf3; color: #15803d; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; }
    .metric-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 9px; }
    .metric-card { padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #edf0f6; border-radius: 11px; min-width: 0; }
    .metric-title { color: #8b95a8; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
    .metric-number { display: block; margin-top: 7px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -.8px; }
    .metric-foot { margin-top: 5px; color: #16a34a; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 750; }
    .chart-card { margin-top: 10px; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid #edf0f6; border-radius: 11px; }
    .chart-title { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; }
    .chart-bars { height: 63px; display: flex; align-items: end; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 3px 0; }
    .chart-bars span { flex: 1; border-radius: 4px 4px 1px 1px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #818cf8, #4f46e5); opacity: .88; }
    .floating-note { position: absolute; right: -24px; bottom: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 13px 15px; border: 1px solid #e9edf5; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(16,24,39,.12); }
    .floating-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 35px; height: 35px; border-radius: 11px; background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; font-size: 17px; }
    .floating-note strong { display: block; font-size: 10px; }
    .floating-note small { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: #8993a7; font-size: 9px; }

    .stats-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 2; margin-top: -1px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: #f8faff; }
    .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .stat { padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #edf0f6; }
    .stat:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .stat strong { display: block; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -1px; }
    .stat span { display: block; margin-top: 7px; color: #818ba0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 650; }

    .section { padding: 94px 0; }
    .section-soft { background: var(--surface-soft); }
    .section-heading { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 45px; text-align: center; }
    .section-kicker { color: var(--brand); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .section-heading h2 { margin: 12px 0 13px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -1.8px; }
    .section-heading p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .feature-card { min-height: 220px; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: #fff; transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s, border-color .2s; }
    .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: #d5d9ff; box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(28,39,76,.07); }
    .feature-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 47px; height: 47px; margin-bottom: 21px; border-radius: 14px; background: #eef2ff; color: #4338ca; font-size: 22px; }
    .feature-card:nth-child(3n+2) .feature-icon { background: #ecfeff; color: #0e7490; }
    .feature-card:nth-child(3n) .feature-icon { background: #f0fdf4; color: #15803d; }
    .feature-card h3 { margin: 0 0 9px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -.35px; }
    .feature-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; }

    .module-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 13px; }
    .module-card { padding: 23px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; text-align: center; transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s; }
    .module-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: #c7d2fe; }
    .module-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 13px; border-radius: 15px; background: #f0f2ff; font-size: 22px; }
    .module-card strong { display: block; font-size: 12px; }
    .module-card small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: #8a94a8; font-size: 10px; }

    .workflow-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; align-items: center; gap: 60px; }
    .workflow-copy .section-kicker { display: inline-block; }
    .workflow-copy h2 { margin: 13px 0 16px; font-size: clamp(31px, 4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -1.8px; }
    .workflow-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; }
    .workflow-list { display: grid; gap: 15px; margin-top: 25px; }
    .workflow-item { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 12px; }
    .workflow-item .check { flex: 0 0 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px; margin-top: 2px; }
    .workflow-item strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
    .workflow-item small { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .workflow-panel { padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #e1e6f2; border-radius: 22px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f2f5ff); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .workflow-panel-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 19px; }
    .workflow-panel-top strong { font-size: 14px; }
    .workflow-panel-top span { padding: 5px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; }
    .task-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e9edf5; }
    .task-avatar { display: grid; place-items: center; flex: 0 0 37px; width: 37px; height: 37px; border-radius: 12px; background: #e0e7ff; color: #4338ca; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 850; }
    .task-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .task-info strong { display: block; font-size: 11px; }
    .task-info small { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: #8a94a8; font-size: 9px; }
    .task-status { padding: 5px 7px; border-radius: 7px; background: #ecfdf3; color: #15803d; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }

    .about-band { padding: 0 0 92px; }
    .about-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; align-items: center; padding: 36px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; }
    .about-card h2 { margin: 10px 0 12px; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -1.2px; }
    .about-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .about-points { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .about-point { padding: 17px; border-radius: 14px; background: #f7f8fc; }
    .about-point strong { display: block; font-size: 12px; }
    .about-point small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.65; }

    .cta-section { padding: 0 0 90px; }
    .cta-box { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 55px 28px; border-radius: 24px; background: linear-gradient(115deg, #101827, #262d58 65%, #164e63); color: #fff; text-align: center; }
    .cta-box::before, .cta-box::after { content: ""; position: absolute; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; }
    .cta-box::before { width: 310px; height: 310px; left: -120px; top: -200px; }
    .cta-box::after { width: 390px; height: 390px; right: -100px; bottom: -290px; }
    .cta-box > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .cta-box h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
    .cta-box p { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; color: #c3c9d8; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .cta-box .button { margin-top: 24px; }

    .site-footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; }
    .footer-main { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 27px 0; }
    .footer-copy { color: #8a94a8; font-size: 11px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; color: #657086; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 650; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--brand); }
    .footer-bottom { padding: 13px 0; border-top: 1px solid #f0f2f7; color: #9aa3b5; font-size: 10px; text-align: center; }

    :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid rgba(79,70,229,.35); outline-offset: 3px; }
    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 42px; }
      .hero-copy { max-width: 720px; }
      .product-preview { width: min(570px, 100%); margin-inline: auto; transform: none; }
      .floating-note { right: -8px; }
      .workflow-grid { gap: 32px; }
      .module-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .nav-links { gap: 17px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 30px, 1160px); }
      .nav { min-height: 70px; }
      .menu-toggle { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; }
      .nav-links {
        display: none; position: absolute; left: 15px; right: 15px; top: 76px;
        padding: 17px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(16,24,39,.12); align-items: stretch; gap: 5px;
      }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      .nav-links > a:not(.button) { padding: 11px 9px; }
      .nav-actions { justify-content: space-between; }
      .nav-actions .button { min-height: 40px; padding-inline: 12px; }
      .hero { padding: 65px 0 55px; }
      .hero h1 { letter-spacing: -2.5px; }
      .hero-copy { font-size: 14px; }
      .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .hero-actions .button { width: 100%; }
      .trust-line { gap: 10px 14px; }
      .preview-body { grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr; min-height: 270px; }
      .preview-main { padding: 13px 10px; }
      .preview-sidebar { padding-inline: 6px; }
      .floating-note { right: 7px; bottom: -24px; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .stat { padding: 20px 12px; }
      .stat:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
      .stat:nth-child(3), .stat:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid #edf0f6; }
      .stat:nth-child(3) { border-right: 1px solid #edf0f6; }
      .section { padding: 70px 0; }
      .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .feature-card { padding: 20px; min-height: auto; }
      .module-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .workflow-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-band { padding-bottom: 70px; }
      .about-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 25px; }
      .cta-section { padding-bottom: 65px; }
      .footer-main { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 440px) {
      .brand-mark { width: 39px; height: 39px; flex-basis: 39px; border-radius: 12px; }
      .brand-name { font-size: 15px; }
      .brand-subtitle { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.2px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 42px; }
      .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .8px; }
      .product-preview { padding: 8px; border-radius: 19px; }
      .preview-sidebar { display: none; }
      .preview-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-box { padding: 42px 20px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; animation-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

   <%- include("partials/navbar", { user: typeof user !== "undefined" ? user : null }) %>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>



  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> <span>Gyans<span>ify</span></span> Human Resource Management</div>
          <h1>People first.<br><span class="gradient-text">HR made simpler.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">
            Bring employee information, attendance, leave requests and everyday HR workflows into one organized workspace. Gyansify HRMS helps your team spend less time chasing paperwork and more time supporting people.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <% if (typeof user !== "undefined" && user) { %>
              <a class="button button-primary" href="/dashboard">Go to Dashboard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <% } else { %>
              <a class="button button-primary" href="/login">Access Your Workspace <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <% } %>
            <a class="button button-outline" href="#features">Explore Features <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-line">
            <span><i class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</i> Centralized employee records</span>
            <span><i class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</i> Clear HR workflows</span>
            <span><i class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</i> Role-aware access</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="product-preview" aria-label="Illustrative HRMS dashboard preview">
          <div class="preview-window">
            <div class="preview-topbar">
              <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
              <span class="preview-label">GYANSIFY WORKSPACE</span>
              <span class="preview-label">HRMS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="preview-body">
              <aside class="preview-sidebar" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="mini-brand"><span class="mini-brand-icon">G</span> Gyansify</div>
                <div class="mini-nav active">Overview</div>
                <div class="mini-nav">Employees</div>
                <div class="mini-nav">Attendance</div>
                <div class="mini-nav">Leave</div>
                <div class="mini-nav">Payroll</div>
              </aside>
              <div class="preview-main">
                <div class="preview-heading">
